{
  "bookId": "rewind-43",
  "id": "chapter-175",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "36715001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "滴……答……滴……答……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "三分钟后爆炸……你们，立刻离开！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "要我看着希塔小姐独自留在这里吗，抱歉，我做不到！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "布鲁特",
          "text": "哦！怎么能让女士来面对危险呢？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "徕卡",
          "text": "三分钟不够，这里的路七弯八拐的，就算走员工通道也至少要五分钟。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "你们两个……嗤，拜托这次可不是什么特殊表演，是真的炸弹哎~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "不从地下走。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715009",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": ">>>「解除开火限制，瞄准正上方，调整输出功率至上最大限。」",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "帕拉斯会轰开上面的天花板，你们从上面走。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "那希塔小姐呢，为什么不和我们一起？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "因为我们上不去。必须依赖她用浮游炮把我们一个一个送上去。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "而这个高度一来一回……剩下的时间只够运三个人上去。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "没有时间了，开火。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715015",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "不！！！不能这样——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "别动。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715017",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "你要做什么？！！放手！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "选红色，还是蓝色呢？\n嘘——我的发卡轻轻一划，引线可能就断了哦~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "克拉拉，你要做什么？！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715020",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "既然大家都没有更好的方式，那就来赌一下概率嘛~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "五十的概率，大家都能活下来；五十的概率，大家死在一起。很棒！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "对了，女巫说我今天的幸运色是红色哦~那么就剪这根吧，怎么样？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715023",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "克拉拉！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "那么真乃喜欢红色还是蓝色呢？我·听·你·的·哦~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "…………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "还有……三十秒，二十九秒，二十八秒，二十七，二十六……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "…………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "快点哦，真乃。不剪的话，爆炸是百分百概率呢。\n十，九，八，七，六……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "红色！！！我也选红色！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715030",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "咔——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "Lucky~看来那个女巫很灵嘛。我今天的幸运色，真的是红色呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "徕卡",
          "text": "呼——真是太刺激了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "真是乱来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715034",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "太好了……大家都没事……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36715035",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "真高兴，又活过了重复无聊的一天！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-877",
