      ],
      "title": "燃烧的乐园·Ⅰ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "36716001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "终于平安地出来了，刚才的经历像做梦一样……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36716002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "多亏了真乃哦~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36716003",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "啊啊啊！！！快跑！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36716004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "打工薯薯",
          "text": "有没有人能救救薯薯我啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36716005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "徕卡",
          "text": "哎，他们跑什么？我这个打扮有这么吓人吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36716006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "怎么这么多人都在往大门的方向跑？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36716007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "不对，难道……不好！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36716008",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "轰——刷拉！",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36716009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "你去哪了，快上车！这里到处都是炸弹！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36716010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "什么？！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36716011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "来不及了，车上说。你们几个，赶快离开这——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36716012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……不行。手办太多了，混乱之下可能会出事。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36716013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "泉，我之前已经通知了边界行动队和管理局，让他们派拆弹专家来。现在这个情况，得有人去负责接他们进来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36716014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "放心，交给我和「阿尔贝尔」吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36716015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "帕拉斯启动自主巡航模式，播放广播引导人群逃离。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36716016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "我也可以一起帮忙！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36716017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "徕卡",
          "text": "这种事怎么能少了徕卡和布鲁特呢，我们也一起帮忙疏散人群。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36716018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "那你呢，侦探小姐？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36716019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "凶手就在这附近，我会找到他。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36716020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "哦？为什么这么说，大侦探？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36716021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "推理。这么大规模的定时炸弹，对凶手来说，是非常盛大的表演仪式。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36716022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "所以之前的连环爆炸案只是凶手的实验而已。凶手不可能不留在附近欣赏自己的杰作。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36716023",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "啪啪啪——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36716024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "鼓掌鼓掌，果然最了解罪犯心理的一定是侦探啊~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36716025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "时间不多了，你们该走了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36716026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "克拉拉！快来——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36716027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "看来大家的安全，要拜托你了呢，拜拜~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-878",
