      "title": "燃烧的乐园·Ⅱ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "36717001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "大家，往这边走，跟我来！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36717002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜",
          "text": "火攻之术，若是当年赤壁……唉，走吧，此地不宜久留。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36717003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "在下昨日夜观星象，今日果然不宜出门。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36717004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "可恶，你们这些凡人有没有看到樱？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36717005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "大家别急！门口的方向在这，不要乱跑，会撞到的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36718001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "唔……好痛……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36718002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "听我说，大家跟着路标，按顺序撤离！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36718003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "但是樱保证了……保证不会走丢的……莉可在哪里……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36718004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "樱，你这样蹲在这很危险，拉着我的手，我带你去大门口。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36718005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36718006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "抱歉，场面太混乱了。\n我先带樱去找莉可，克拉拉你先去游乐园大门口——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36718007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "时间要到了，真乃。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36718008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "没关系，相信我的速度，一定能赶在爆炸之前会和的，放心吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36718009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "不不不，我是说烟花秀的时间快到了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36718010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "诶？可是这种情况，烟花秀应该取消了吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36718011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "啊，那真可惜……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36718012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "樱看到了，是狐狸哥哥和狐狸弟弟！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36718013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "什么狐狸？啊，是周瑜和孔明先生……太好了，莉可也在那！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36718014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "真乃想不想看一场特别的烟花演出？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36718015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "莉可！莉可！星星姐姐，我们……可以走了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36718016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "星星姐姐？\n抱歉，克拉拉，你刚才说什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36718017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "我说……一会见。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36718018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "嗯！一会门口见！小心点，我们走了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36718019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "那么，一会见哟~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
