      ],
      "title": "燃烧的乐园·Ⅳ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "36720001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "「徕卡」",
          "text": "「有请我的搭档登场！」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "「布鲁特」",
          "text": "「还不快献上掌声！」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "「真乃」",
          "text": "「有什么我帮得上的忙吗？」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "「徕卡」",
          "text": "「为我……报仇……」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "「希塔」",
          "text": "「全员就位，准备迎敌。」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "「真乃」",
          "text": "「为什么……是你……」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "「徕卡」",
          "text": "「找我吗？」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "「希塔」",
          "text": "「目标锁定，全功率射击！」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "「真乃」",
          "text": "「克拉拉，为什么？！！！」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "啊哈哈哈，你们真是无聊到——爆！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "咯咯咯，好了，无聊的表演到此结束。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "倒计数结束的时候，无论什么都会在绚烂的焰火中燃烧殆尽！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "啊！最最最喜欢在那一瞬间爆发出的刺眼光芒了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "仓田真乃……你还能给我什么样的惊喜呢，真是期待呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "「真乃」",
          "text": "「正义的英雄，是不能退缩的。」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "湛蓝的晨星，碎掉的瞬间一定超·级·好·看，哈哈哈哈！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720017",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "滴答……滴答……滴答……\n499……498……497……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "徕卡先生？！\n不！不可以去开那个门！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720019",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "text": "嘭嘭嘭嘭！！！嘭——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "咳咳……太好了……大家没事……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "徕卡",
          "text": "完美的谢幕！有想合影的观众吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "喂，要是气球半空就爆炸了，你可就彻底谢幕了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "徕卡",
          "text": "哈哈哈哈，那只能让大家替我和布鲁特报仇了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "用气球带着炸弹升高，然后在空中把气球击碎，避免爆炸的冲击伤到大家……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "徕卡先生好厉害！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "布鲁特",
          "text": "喂，布鲁特的份在哪？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "总之门开了，你们赶快离开这里，我要去接人。阿尔贝尔，出发！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "哼，果然没有什么能威胁到本王！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "既然门打开了，大家也都能安全离开了，赶紧回家去吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "等等……你们有人看到克拉拉吗？！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "嗯，容在下一算，你所寻之人在东。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "樱",
          "text": "诶……星星姐姐，你要去哪？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "我要回去！我的朋友还在游乐园里！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36720034",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "周瑜",
          "text": "为何她往北跑去了？罢了，此地不宜久留。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
